Rāvaṇa commissions five generals to seize Hanumān --- Rāvaṇa warns monkey is mighty being and counsels caution --- Generals surround roaring Hanumān on tōraṇa --- Hanumān crushes Durdhara chariot and kills him --- Hanumān kills Virūpākṣa and Yūpākṣa with sāla tree --- Hanumān kills Praghasa and Bhāsakarṇa with mountain peak --- Hanumān destroys remaining horse elephant chariot army --- Hanumān retakes tōraṇa like Death at dissolution